WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.100 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 21]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:58.230 --> 01:59.790
Mr. Zhang, how have you been?

02:01.510 --> 02:03.130
I never expected to meet you here

02:04.710 --> 02:05.620
after all these years.

02:07.640 --> 02:08.570
You still remember me?

02:14.240 --> 02:16.130
What you did in Changsha

02:16.870 --> 02:18.130
is still fresh in my mind.

02:19.270 --> 02:20.380
How could I forget you?

02:21.710 --> 02:23.980
Times have changed.

02:25.240 --> 02:26.980
You and Mr. Yin are family now,

02:28.080 --> 02:29.410
and I'm also here

02:29.430 --> 02:30.380
to do business with him.

02:31.400 --> 02:32.410
I'd call that fate.

02:34.000 --> 02:34.660
Mr. Zhang,

02:35.680 --> 02:37.170
why not be friends with me?

02:37.470 --> 02:39.170
Given your situation now, it'd serve you well.

02:40.080 --> 02:41.130
Friends value loyalty.

02:42.710 --> 02:43.660
Merchants value profit.

02:45.000 --> 02:46.890
You're a merchant, Mr. Hendry.

02:47.840 --> 02:49.060
Since you helped me,

02:50.430 --> 02:51.060
you must be here

02:51.080 --> 02:52.130
to talk business, aren't you?

02:54.630 --> 02:55.730
Business and friendship

02:55.750 --> 02:56.610
need not conflict.

02:57.710 --> 02:58.170
Look,

02:58.870 --> 03:00.010
we Americans in China

03:00.030 --> 03:02.060
have built universities, hospitals, and newspapers.

03:02.430 --> 03:03.940
That shows our willingness

03:03.960 --> 03:05.060
to befriend China.

03:06.150 --> 03:07.500
China needs friends,

03:07.560 --> 03:08.730
not masters.

03:10.240 --> 03:11.290
We only want

03:11.310 --> 03:12.450
mutually beneficial cooperation.

03:14.190 --> 03:16.220
I'm in the antique trade.

03:16.800 --> 03:17.820
I've set my sights

03:17.870 --> 03:19.660
on the ancient Chu tombs between Xiangtan and Yueyang.

03:20.560 --> 03:22.780
I want exclusive control of that trade route.

03:24.280 --> 03:25.940
If the treasures can leave China smoothly,

03:26.280 --> 03:27.410
Chinese antiquities can

03:27.430 --> 03:28.340
gain renown overseas

03:28.840 --> 03:30.780
while bringing back hard cash.

03:31.750 --> 03:32.730
Everyone benefits.

03:35.310 --> 03:36.340
Times have changed.

03:36.910 --> 03:38.780
You need to change with them.

03:39.520 --> 03:41.540
Those who stand still will be left behind.

03:44.190 --> 03:46.060
I won't do business selling off

03:46.400 --> 03:47.130
our ancestors' legacy.

03:50.710 --> 03:51.690
Only by holding on to our roots

03:53.470 --> 03:56.730
can Chinese people remain Chinese.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.500
No one can change that.

04:00.910 --> 04:01.660
Besides,

04:02.680 --> 04:03.850
our descendants

04:03.870 --> 04:05.010
will be watching us.

04:06.310 --> 04:07.290
No Chinese person

04:08.470 --> 04:10.170
would do such a thing.

04:11.910 --> 04:13.100
Perhaps it's simply too difficult

04:13.470 --> 04:14.690
for you to understand.

04:18.800 --> 04:20.020
What our roots mean to us

04:20.690 --> 04:21.980
is something you could never understand.

04:22.680 --> 04:23.700
Take me to the train station.

04:34.190 --> 04:34.700
Sir,

04:35.480 --> 04:36.340
we've confirmed

04:36.360 --> 04:37.100
that man's identity.

04:37.750 --> 04:39.170
He's the Changsha Defense Commander,

04:39.600 --> 04:40.580
Zhang Qishan.

04:41.270 --> 04:42.220
Zhang Qishan?

04:46.700 --> 04:48.380
[Zhang Qishan]

04:49.920 --> 04:51.580
He infiltrated the Beiping auction

04:51.600 --> 04:53.140
with a false identity?

04:55.190 --> 04:56.290
He abandoned his post

04:56.430 --> 04:57.290
and overstepped his authority.

04:57.390 --> 04:58.700
He should face military justice!

05:01.390 --> 05:02.930
Notify Nanjing immediately

05:03.430 --> 05:05.140
and demand an explanation from them!

05:05.240 --> 05:05.700
Yes!

05:16.750 --> 05:17.250
Sir,

05:18.360 --> 05:19.100
the Beiping Office

05:19.120 --> 05:20.490
of the Japanese Foreign Affairs Ministry called.

05:22.830 --> 05:24.370
Torii Tottori has accused Zhang Qishan

05:25.190 --> 05:26.960
of assuming a false identity,

05:27.040 --> 05:28.390
deliberately provoking a diplomatic incident,

05:28.630 --> 05:29.700
and violating the Sino-Japanese agreement.

05:30.070 --> 05:31.850
He demands that Nanjing be notified at once

05:32.430 --> 05:33.140
and Zhang be severely punished.

05:33.950 --> 05:34.610
Otherwise,

05:36.000 --> 05:38.250
he will report it to the Japanese Foreign Affairs Ministry in Tokyo

05:38.750 --> 05:40.730
as a hostile act

05:40.870 --> 05:41.610
at the government level.

05:48.830 --> 05:49.610
This matter

05:50.120 --> 05:51.170
may still take a different turn.

05:52.270 --> 05:53.100
Don't report it yet.

05:54.120 --> 05:54.610
Understood.

06:11.630 --> 06:12.660
Why are you helping me?

06:13.240 --> 06:14.100
To avoid trouble.

06:15.040 --> 06:16.780
If Tottori catches you,

06:17.430 --> 06:19.250
an already troublesome situation

06:19.360 --> 06:20.700
will become even worse.

06:21.870 --> 06:23.020
Have you thought about it?

06:24.040 --> 06:25.730
Even if you had gotten the medicine,

06:26.480 --> 06:28.220
would that have ended things?

06:32.630 --> 06:34.370
Knowing Torii Tottori,

06:35.720 --> 06:36.810
I'm sure he wouldn't let me off.

06:37.950 --> 06:39.020
I was too impatient.

06:44.070 --> 06:45.410
But perhaps this is for the best.

06:46.270 --> 06:47.370
Since I don't have long to live,

06:48.630 --> 06:50.050
he won't keep targeting the Huo Clan.

06:51.630 --> 06:53.340
Why give up so quickly?

06:57.950 --> 06:59.660
This is called mold filtrate.

06:59.750 --> 07:00.660
It was developed

07:00.680 --> 07:01.490
by the British.

07:01.630 --> 07:03.170
I hear it's still at the experimental stage.

07:04.160 --> 07:05.200
If you're brave enough,

07:05.200 --> 07:06.900
you can test it for them.

07:11.580 --> 07:13.420
[MOULD FILTRATE]

07:18.240 --> 07:19.540
Why exactly are you helping me?

07:21.120 --> 07:22.020
Once I die,

07:22.920 --> 07:23.580
won't it be easier

07:23.600 --> 07:25.100
to settle things

07:25.560 --> 07:26.050
peacefully?

07:27.360 --> 07:28.490
If a problem

07:28.510 --> 07:30.610
can only be solved by a young woman's death,

07:31.920 --> 07:32.610
Xinyue Restaurant

07:32.630 --> 07:34.100
might as well close its doors.

07:37.600 --> 07:38.540
You're a businessman.

07:40.160 --> 07:41.460
You care only about results.

07:42.310 --> 07:43.020
That's right.

07:44.070 --> 07:45.170
But you're one of the very few

07:45.190 --> 07:46.220
I've met

07:46.830 --> 07:48.580
who still look to the road ahead

07:49.240 --> 07:51.220
knowing they have little time left.

07:52.800 --> 07:53.410
You know,

07:53.430 --> 07:55.340
most people in this world

07:55.430 --> 07:56.810
are searching for a way to survive.

07:57.750 --> 07:59.730
Very few know what they're

08:00.720 --> 08:01.490
living for.

08:06.560 --> 08:07.730
The world to come

08:08.680 --> 08:09.660
needs people like you.

08:46.030 --> 08:46.610
Master Zhang,

08:48.670 --> 08:50.060
why haven't Heibei and Chen Pi

08:50.510 --> 08:51.530
shown up yet?

08:52.720 --> 08:53.940
Could something have happened?

09:03.000 --> 09:03.530
Heibei!

09:04.910 --> 09:05.460
Heibei,

09:06.150 --> 09:06.820
are you all right?

09:07.240 --> 09:09.770
Food's hard to come by here.

09:10.270 --> 09:11.530
I'd rather go back to Changsha.

09:15.030 --> 09:15.770
Where's Chen Pi?

09:23.910 --> 09:24.460
Chen Pi!

10:17.720 --> 10:18.220
Tiezui!

10:21.270 --> 10:21.820
Master Zhang.

10:22.870 --> 10:23.490
Doesn't he look like...?

10:28.200 --> 10:28.770
A little.

10:30.600 --> 10:31.580
Could he be...?

10:33.910 --> 10:34.580
It's possible.

10:44.030 --> 10:44.890
His breathing is weak.

10:45.790 --> 10:47.060
His face is shriveled and gaunt.

10:47.840 --> 10:50.250
There must be some toxin in his body.

10:51.120 --> 10:52.650
Since he's dressed in a Daoist robe,

10:53.480 --> 10:54.420
at first glance,

10:55.000 --> 10:56.180
he could be mistaken for an ascended mummy.

10:58.790 --> 11:00.130
What a risky move.

11:00.750 --> 11:02.940
Laogou disguised himself as an ascended mummy

11:04.000 --> 11:05.130
so Xinyue Restaurant could fish him out

11:05.840 --> 11:07.130
and send him to Beiping for auction.

11:07.750 --> 11:08.610
But what if Xinyue Restaurant

11:08.630 --> 11:09.730
hadn't found him?

11:11.240 --> 11:13.730
The current would've carried him into the Jinsha River

11:14.390 --> 11:15.220
for a water burial.

11:17.440 --> 11:18.060
I suppose

11:18.080 --> 11:19.010
he anticipated that.

11:19.670 --> 11:20.940
He had no choice but to risk his life.

11:21.320 --> 11:21.940
He was gambling

11:22.360 --> 11:23.850
on being pulled from the water

11:24.270 --> 11:26.700
and on us finding him.

11:28.630 --> 11:29.940
The risk was enormous.

11:30.840 --> 11:32.460
Either Laogou had no other way to survive

11:32.630 --> 11:33.490
and risked everything,

11:34.790 --> 11:35.420
or

11:36.630 --> 11:37.460
he had a compelling reason

11:37.480 --> 11:38.580
to get out of there.

11:39.030 --> 11:40.530
But Laogou

11:40.550 --> 11:41.650
is a clever man.

11:42.150 --> 11:43.610
Before he lost consciousness,

11:43.960 --> 11:44.980
he must have

11:45.000 --> 11:47.060
left us some kind of clue

11:47.550 --> 11:49.130
or hint.

11:50.270 --> 11:51.060
You're right.

11:52.240 --> 11:52.770
Adjutant.

11:53.080 --> 11:53.580
Tweezers.

12:21.550 --> 12:22.650
This was drawn by Laogou.

12:25.750 --> 12:26.460
It...

12:26.910 --> 12:28.100
It's a clock face.

12:30.630 --> 12:31.250
I see.

12:31.750 --> 12:32.980
What Laogou is trying to tell us

12:33.120 --> 12:34.100
has something to do with time.

12:35.080 --> 12:35.530
But

12:36.750 --> 12:38.180
what exactly is he trying to tell us?

12:41.720 --> 12:43.220
The Japanese captured Laogou,

12:43.510 --> 12:44.530
and he risked his life to escape.

12:46.200 --> 12:47.980
They've probably already made their move.

12:48.790 --> 12:50.460
Perhaps he's telling us

12:51.960 --> 12:52.890
we're running out of time.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.180
What's this, Master Zhang?

13:12.270 --> 13:13.650
I know. This thing...

13:14.320 --> 13:14.700
Master Zhang.

13:15.150 --> 13:15.610
Master Zhang,

13:15.960 --> 13:16.300
what...?

13:16.510 --> 13:17.890
Why did you make him swallow it?

13:17.960 --> 13:18.940
What if something goes wrong?

13:20.870 --> 13:21.420
What?

13:22.790 --> 13:23.730
If it's not for him,

13:23.960 --> 13:24.700
then who?

13:30.870 --> 13:32.940
He must've been in that chest for days.

13:34.080 --> 13:35.490
An ordinary person would've died already.

13:35.630 --> 13:36.530
We need a doctor.

13:38.000 --> 13:38.820
Laogou must've used

13:38.870 --> 13:39.610
some special method.

13:40.750 --> 13:42.060
A doctor probably won't help.

13:44.080 --> 13:45.370
He's this weak now

13:46.000 --> 13:47.100
because we never realized

13:47.120 --> 13:48.220
he was inside.

13:49.080 --> 13:50.940
We were far too complacent.

13:52.080 --> 13:53.370
We may get him killed this time.

13:53.990 --> 13:55.780
Turtle Breathing requires a stable environment.

13:56.150 --> 13:57.460
I do know a few ways

13:57.750 --> 13:58.570
to revive and stabilize him.

13:59.280 --> 14:00.260
He just took the pill.

14:01.040 --> 14:01.940
If it's effective,

14:02.280 --> 14:03.420
Laogou should

14:03.560 --> 14:04.530
already be recovering.

14:04.670 --> 14:05.260
I don't believe it.

14:06.280 --> 14:07.130
I can't help but worry.

14:08.080 --> 14:09.260
You carry a baleful aura.

14:10.030 --> 14:10.970
Stay back.

14:11.310 --> 14:12.420
I can definitely save him.

14:16.630 --> 14:17.920
I know every remedy in the book

14:17.920 --> 14:19.340
and specialize in difficult ailments.

14:20.150 --> 14:22.100
Powdered star anise mixed with strong liquor

14:22.870 --> 14:24.130
will boost the pill's efficacy.

14:32.200 --> 14:32.850
Dress the wounds properly.

14:33.270 --> 14:33.980
Don't let them get infected.

14:34.240 --> 14:34.730
Yes.

14:47.600 --> 14:48.580
Laogou still hasn't woken up?

14:54.670 --> 14:56.060
Something was already

14:57.320 --> 14:58.730
very wrong with you at the auction.

14:59.790 --> 15:00.980
What really happened?

15:04.960 --> 15:06.180
It's been many years.

15:06.480 --> 15:07.180
Indeed.

15:07.670 --> 15:08.460
Now,

15:09.630 --> 15:11.340
I suppose I should call you Officer Luo.

15:14.240 --> 15:16.730
What official business brings you here today?

15:18.080 --> 15:19.340
The Japanese have been

15:19.400 --> 15:21.060
collecting our antiques and paintings everywhere.

15:21.550 --> 15:22.370
The Central Government

15:22.480 --> 15:23.250
has just established

15:23.270 --> 15:24.600
a Cultural Heritage Preservation Committee.

15:25.120 --> 15:26.980
I'm here to find out what's really going on.

15:27.960 --> 15:28.610
We can't

15:28.790 --> 15:30.300
let everything our ancestors left us

15:30.510 --> 15:31.890
fall into foreign hands.

15:39.870 --> 15:41.300
Chen Minzhi?

15:44.440 --> 15:45.250
Now that's strange.

15:48.080 --> 15:49.700
Do you dislike your old name?

15:53.240 --> 15:54.010
Relax.

15:55.390 --> 15:56.540
I know you came

15:56.540 --> 15:57.220
with Zhang.

15:58.200 --> 15:59.340
He had little choice himself.

16:00.000 --> 16:00.980
Circumstances forced his hand.

16:01.600 --> 16:02.890
Official business was only

16:03.510 --> 16:04.700
part of why I came to Beiping.

16:05.910 --> 16:07.420
What I really wanted was to see an old friend.

16:15.960 --> 16:18.370
You found time to catch up despite your duties.

16:19.390 --> 16:21.300
There must be something important to discuss.

16:21.750 --> 16:23.130
The Central Government is drafting

16:23.360 --> 16:24.940
regulations to purge local armed groups.

16:25.150 --> 16:25.820
Any organization not incorporated

16:25.840 --> 16:26.890
into the central military system

16:27.150 --> 16:28.100
will be disbanded,

16:28.270 --> 16:29.850
disarmed, and outlawed.

16:31.440 --> 16:32.130
The Mystic Nine

16:33.000 --> 16:34.100
is among them.

16:35.440 --> 16:37.940
Back when we were classmates,

16:38.200 --> 16:40.580
you often lamented that even without foreign threats, the country

16:40.600 --> 16:41.460
still had troubles within.

16:42.120 --> 16:43.580
Now you hold high office.

16:43.910 --> 16:45.460
Once that regulation takes effect,

16:46.120 --> 16:47.490
it will carry far more weight

16:47.960 --> 16:49.100
than those words ever did.

16:50.030 --> 16:51.460
I have little choice.

16:53.790 --> 16:54.890
How far

16:55.600 --> 16:56.890
will the outlawing go?

16:57.840 --> 16:59.580
With foreign enemies watching closely,

17:00.080 --> 17:01.370
we cannot tolerate any private armed force

17:01.390 --> 17:02.300
getting in the way in the rear.

17:02.600 --> 17:03.850
If the country is unstable within,

17:04.240 --> 17:05.460
turmoil will follow without.

17:05.960 --> 17:07.220
Groups like the Mystic Nine

17:07.350 --> 17:08.570
will inevitably be the first targets.

17:08.960 --> 17:10.180
None can be allowed to remain.

17:12.070 --> 17:13.810
But the Mystic Nine have done much

17:13.830 --> 17:14.900
to keep the region stable.

17:15.440 --> 17:17.090
If they're all wiped out,

17:17.590 --> 17:19.490
it could endanger the situation,

17:20.110 --> 17:22.050
and their followers across the region won't stay quiet.

17:23.070 --> 17:24.700
That's why I came to see you.

17:26.110 --> 17:26.980
I know

17:28.310 --> 17:30.050
not everyone in the Mystic Nine is wicked.

17:30.440 --> 17:32.380
I respect Zhang Qishan's loyalty and courage,

17:32.680 --> 17:34.220
and your strong sense of principle.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.010
If Changsha

17:36.440 --> 17:38.180
loses this vital force one day,

17:39.400 --> 17:40.660
I'll grieve too.

17:41.400 --> 17:42.570
How much time do we have?

17:43.070 --> 17:44.660
The order will reach the provinces soon.

17:45.200 --> 17:46.090
No more than a month.

17:46.790 --> 17:49.250
If I help you delay any longer, it'll be favoritism.

17:49.830 --> 17:50.490
Mr. Xie,

17:50.920 --> 17:52.220
you're a businessman.

17:52.550 --> 17:54.050
No one reads the situation better than you.

17:56.440 --> 17:57.900
If the Mystic Nine can't be saved,

17:58.920 --> 18:01.730
please don't let Changsha erupt in violence overnight.

18:15.270 --> 18:16.050
One month.

18:17.680 --> 18:19.010
Enough time to prepare my coffin.

18:19.550 --> 18:20.050
Mr. Luo,

18:20.440 --> 18:22.530
I won't forget what you told me today.

18:23.160 --> 18:24.250
I'll give you

18:24.270 --> 18:25.330
a satisfactory answer.

18:29.400 --> 18:30.660
May this drink

18:31.720 --> 18:32.810
not be our last.

18:37.200 --> 18:38.290
It's just my craving acting up.

18:39.510 --> 18:40.620
Once we're back in Changsha,

18:41.200 --> 18:42.620
I'll need to recuperate properly.

18:54.350 --> 18:55.250
After we return,

18:55.830 --> 18:57.380
I'll need you to come to my residence.

18:58.350 --> 19:00.010
As for the false accusation that you colluded with the enemy,

19:00.270 --> 19:01.860
I'll need some time to clear it up.

19:02.510 --> 19:03.490
Someone's handling it.

19:08.200 --> 19:09.620
At Xinyue Restaurant,

19:10.270 --> 19:11.260
I ran into an old friend,

19:11.680 --> 19:12.730
a senior official in the Ministry of War.

19:13.400 --> 19:14.940
He said he'd take care of it.

19:15.590 --> 19:16.570
Once we're back in Changsha,

19:17.480 --> 19:18.530
I'll be cleared of all charges.

19:20.310 --> 19:21.180
Which official?

19:22.440 --> 19:23.180
Do I know him?

19:24.240 --> 19:25.290
A friend from my school days.

19:26.110 --> 19:26.860
You don't know him.

19:40.200 --> 19:41.290
I didn't expect

19:41.510 --> 19:42.730
Cox Hendry to show up too.

19:43.880 --> 19:45.250
He was after the artifact chests too, wasn't he?

19:46.880 --> 19:47.620
What did he say to you?

19:49.960 --> 19:51.140
On the surface, he wanted

19:51.160 --> 19:52.900
to work with me to smuggle antiquities,

19:53.920 --> 19:54.980
but in truth,

19:56.200 --> 19:57.660
he has designs on Changsha.

20:00.110 --> 20:01.770
Changsha is a strategic gateway

20:02.070 --> 20:03.140
to the south and west.

20:04.270 --> 20:05.490
If war breaks out,

20:06.510 --> 20:08.900
it will certainly become fiercely contested.

20:10.400 --> 20:12.900
Perhaps he sees me as someone who moves

20:13.310 --> 20:15.180
between civilian and military circles,

20:16.200 --> 20:17.140
someone easy to use

20:17.510 --> 20:18.660
to help him control Changsha.

20:19.550 --> 20:21.250
We haven't even dealt with the Japanese,

20:21.680 --> 20:22.730
and now the Americans are here too.

20:24.880 --> 20:26.530
We'll deal with whatever comes.

20:27.640 --> 20:28.090
Master Zhang,

20:28.880 --> 20:30.250
if Laogou truly can't wake up,

20:30.960 --> 20:31.810
what will you do?

20:33.200 --> 20:34.380
He will wake up.

20:35.480 --> 20:36.660
The Japanese back at Xinyue Restaurant

20:36.680 --> 20:38.180
were after that artifact chest.

20:39.680 --> 20:41.460
Japanese forces are everywhere now.

20:42.830 --> 20:44.460
The situation could change at any moment.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.660
If we want to find out quickly

20:46.680 --> 20:47.530
what the Japanese are planning,

20:48.270 --> 20:49.420
Laogou is our only lead.

20:52.030 --> 20:53.220
Why are the Japanese

20:53.240 --> 20:54.330
so fixated on Laogou?

20:55.270 --> 20:57.090
What secret does he hold?

21:00.680 --> 21:01.140
Master Zhang.

21:02.110 --> 21:02.770
Fifth Master is awake.

21:03.880 --> 21:04.330
Master Zhang,

21:05.160 --> 21:06.140
he seems to have lost his memory.

21:19.070 --> 21:19.530
Laogou.

21:24.720 --> 21:25.330
Laogou,

21:26.720 --> 21:27.700
what happened?

21:40.750 --> 21:42.250
What exactly happened?

21:47.640 --> 21:49.050
Do you know who you are?

21:53.000 --> 21:53.810
Then do you know

21:53.830 --> 21:55.250
who wreaked havoc in Heaven?

21:56.270 --> 21:57.250
The Great Sage Equaling Heaven,

21:58.310 --> 21:59.140
Sun Wukong.

22:09.400 --> 22:10.090
Who are you?

22:11.750 --> 22:12.700
And who am I?

22:19.680 --> 22:20.700
Your name is Wu Laogou.

22:22.790 --> 22:23.980
I'm Zhang Qishan.

22:28.880 --> 22:29.810
I'm taking you home.

22:37.860 --> 22:41.310
[Exit]

22:41.310 --> 22:42.290
Laogou went to such lengths

22:42.310 --> 22:43.330
to get that note out.

22:44.070 --> 22:44.940
It may hold the truth

22:44.960 --> 22:45.940
about the Otherworld Tower.

22:46.480 --> 22:47.720
He must have known

22:47.750 --> 22:49.000
Turtle Breathing would erase his memory,

22:49.350 --> 22:50.880
so he hid the clues in the note.

22:52.350 --> 22:53.900
But none of us can decipher it.

22:56.270 --> 22:57.250
Let's ask the Wu Clan.

23:01.100 --> 23:08.980
[Changsha]

23:11.220 --> 23:13.220
[Wu's Residence]

23:24.590 --> 23:25.570
This is my home?

23:38.720 --> 23:39.530
Wow.

23:40.400 --> 23:41.180
It's lively here.

23:41.830 --> 23:42.810
Do I raise dogs for a living?

23:43.790 --> 23:45.460
That's only one of your businesses.

23:46.110 --> 23:46.810
More importantly,

23:47.720 --> 23:49.180
you're the Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine.

23:50.880 --> 23:51.900
The Mystic Nine?

23:53.880 --> 23:55.330
Sounds like some gang of hoodlums.

23:56.550 --> 23:58.660
Just look at me. I'm clearly a decent man.

23:58.960 --> 24:00.380
I'd never be in that line of work.

24:02.960 --> 24:03.380
Little bird.

24:04.270 --> 24:04.810
Come here.

24:05.640 --> 24:06.090
Come here.

24:06.720 --> 24:07.380
Fifth Master?

24:09.030 --> 24:09.530
Master!

24:11.440 --> 24:12.220
Master is back!

24:12.790 --> 24:13.770
Master is back!

24:14.720 --> 24:15.330
He's back?

24:15.480 --> 24:16.180
Master!

24:16.310 --> 24:17.290
- Master! - Master!

24:17.440 --> 24:17.980
Where is he?

24:18.000 --> 24:18.770
- Master! - Master!

24:19.790 --> 24:20.620
- Master! - Master!

24:20.640 --> 24:22.420
- Master! - Master!

24:22.550 --> 24:23.460
You're back!

24:23.750 --> 24:24.420
It really is you!

24:24.440 --> 24:25.460
Where have you been all this time?

24:25.480 --> 24:26.380
We were worried sick.

24:26.720 --> 24:27.900
I knew you were still alive.

24:28.030 --> 24:28.620
Where did you go?

24:28.640 --> 24:29.700
We missed you so much!

24:29.720 --> 24:31.460
- That's right, Master!
- We really missed you!

24:31.880 --> 24:32.380
Master?

24:36.160 --> 24:36.770
Who...

24:38.160 --> 24:38.900
Who are you?

24:39.160 --> 24:40.490
We work for you, Master.

24:40.510 --> 24:40.920
Yeah.

24:40.920 --> 24:42.180
Master, stop messing with us.

24:43.200 --> 24:43.940
You work for me?

24:47.070 --> 24:48.490
So I really am the Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine?

24:55.310 --> 24:55.730
Master Zhang,

24:56.790 --> 24:57.730
what's wrong with Fifth Master?

24:57.880 --> 24:58.770
Doesn't he recognize us?

25:00.310 --> 25:01.010
He's lost his memory.

25:02.680 --> 25:03.490
Lost his memory?

25:03.740 --> 25:04.620
Master.

25:05.000 --> 25:05.860
Are you hurt? Where?

25:05.880 --> 25:06.770
Don't grab at me.

25:06.770 --> 25:07.380
Let me see.

25:07.440 --> 25:08.050
Put the knife down.

25:08.110 --> 25:08.940
Put it down.

25:18.720 --> 25:19.620
Remember anything?

25:21.480 --> 25:21.980
Listen.

25:23.510 --> 25:24.490
Take good care of him.

25:25.240 --> 25:26.250
If he remembers anything,

25:26.550 --> 25:27.250
tell me at once.

25:29.070 --> 25:29.530
Wait.

25:32.480 --> 25:33.380
These bandits

25:35.510 --> 25:36.900
don't look like decent people.

25:38.350 --> 25:39.420
You're an official, aren't you?

25:39.790 --> 25:40.660
Your place must be comfortable.

25:40.960 --> 25:41.620
I'll stay with you.

25:42.680 --> 25:43.810
- Master! - Master!

25:43.880 --> 25:44.530
Master!

25:44.720 --> 25:45.940
Master, where are you going?

25:46.200 --> 25:47.660
This is your home!

25:47.720 --> 25:48.290
Yeah!

26:00.000 --> 26:00.900
You never used to come

26:01.920 --> 26:03.010
to my residence.

26:03.790 --> 26:05.010
Why wouldn't I come

26:06.000 --> 26:06.700
to a place this nice?

26:08.350 --> 26:09.380
It's full of soldiers.

26:09.960 --> 26:11.140
Maybe you never felt safe here.

26:14.550 --> 26:15.660
You're hiding something from me.

26:18.960 --> 26:19.530
Never mind.

26:20.400 --> 26:21.330
Give me time,

26:21.720 --> 26:22.530
and I'll figure it out.

26:23.440 --> 26:25.380
You'll stay here from now on.

26:26.960 --> 26:27.420
Master Zhang.

26:28.680 --> 26:29.290
Everything

26:29.590 --> 26:30.660
Fifth Master needs has been

26:30.680 --> 26:31.380
prepared to his liking.

26:31.920 --> 26:32.290
Good.

26:33.350 --> 26:34.460
To my liking?

26:39.720 --> 26:40.810
Did we know each other well?

26:55.000 --> 26:55.900
Get some rest.

26:56.830 --> 26:57.860
If you remember anything,

26:58.270 --> 26:59.050
tell me anytime.

27:00.000 --> 27:01.460
Tomorrow, I'll look for doctors

27:01.750 --> 27:02.900
and see if anyone can treat you.

27:09.830 --> 27:10.290
Master Zhang,

27:11.550 --> 27:12.330
the Wu Clan said

27:13.030 --> 27:14.330
they'd never seen the symbols

27:14.400 --> 27:15.420
on that note before,

27:16.110 --> 27:16.900
so they couldn't decipher them.

27:17.070 --> 27:18.700
We may have to wait until Fifth Master recovers

27:18.750 --> 27:19.490
before we can decipher it.

27:21.240 --> 27:22.420
He expected he might die,

27:23.110 --> 27:24.330
so he must have believed

27:24.440 --> 27:25.530
someone could decipher the note.

27:25.880 --> 27:26.620
Who?

27:27.720 --> 27:28.290
Xiangu.

27:29.270 --> 27:30.660
This note was meant for her.

27:31.880 --> 27:32.860
She should be able to decipher it.

27:34.000 --> 27:35.140
Then I'll ask Miss Huo to come.

27:35.640 --> 27:36.860
Take the note to her.

27:37.720 --> 27:38.220
Yes.

28:15.790 --> 28:16.250
Fifth Master.

28:17.590 --> 28:18.940
I couldn't sleep, so I came out for a walk.

28:19.440 --> 28:20.490
I'm not going to get shot, am I?

28:21.550 --> 28:22.570
Just don't disturb Master Zhang.

28:57.550 --> 28:58.530
Master Zhang

28:58.590 --> 28:59.530
doesn't trust me, does he?

28:59.960 --> 29:00.700
I don't trust you.

29:01.240 --> 29:02.290
But I don't speak for Master Zhang.

29:04.880 --> 29:05.420
What kind of person

29:05.440 --> 29:06.420
was I before?

29:07.400 --> 29:08.490
Either remember it yourself,

29:09.400 --> 29:10.420
or let Master Zhang tell you.

29:11.000 --> 29:11.730
You're that loyal to him?

29:13.920 --> 29:14.940
You should be called Puppy Zhang instead.

29:24.790 --> 29:25.250
Master Zhang.

29:26.240 --> 29:27.220
Miss Huo is here to see you.

29:46.240 --> 29:46.700
Master Zhang,

29:47.440 --> 29:48.860
I heard you brought Laogou back.

29:49.680 --> 29:50.330
I've come to see him.

29:50.640 --> 29:52.010
Did you decipher the note?

29:52.550 --> 29:53.460
What exactly does it say?

29:53.960 --> 29:55.220
Is it related to the Otherworld Tower?

29:56.200 --> 29:57.530
I only understood part of it.

29:59.400 --> 30:00.460
I'd like to see him first.

30:03.160 --> 30:04.180
All right. Come with me.

30:07.160 --> 30:08.140
But prepare yourself.

30:35.270 --> 30:35.810
Laogou.

30:55.920 --> 30:56.860
Don't you remember me?

30:59.030 --> 30:59.770
Who are you?

31:02.160 --> 31:03.010
I'm Xiangu.

31:06.640 --> 31:07.660
You're one of the Mystic Nine too?

31:09.510 --> 31:10.330
I've lost my memory.

31:10.500 --> 31:15.580
♪Your beauty resembles a pristine portrait♪

31:16.020 --> 31:21.140
♪When will the white horse return? I keep thinking about you♪

31:21.580 --> 31:27.020
♪I ask the water of Yique, who has moved into my heart?♪

31:27.460 --> 31:33.340
♪Pinching time with my fingertips, my longing for you keeps me awake...♪

31:38.030 --> 31:39.050
You really don't remember?

31:39.740 --> 31:44.940
♪The story continues for millennia, and your beauty remains...♪

31:45.680 --> 31:46.620
Miss, please show some restraint.

31:49.000 --> 31:50.010
You're not pretending, are you?

31:50.640 --> 31:51.220
Pretending?

31:58.640 --> 31:59.980
Were you really that important to me?

32:01.220 --> 32:06.300
♪Don't let your misguided devotion squander away your youth...♪

32:06.310 --> 32:07.810
Why don't I remember you at all?

32:12.700 --> 32:18.500
♪I wish my heart would keep shining as it did when we first met...♪

32:20.110 --> 32:20.700
Perhaps

32:25.550 --> 32:26.700
this is fate.

32:30.500 --> 32:35.700
♪Why fear the storms and all their changes?♪

32:36.420 --> 32:46.580
♪I wish my heart would keep shining as it did when we first met♪

32:54.160 --> 32:54.770
Master Zhang.

33:01.550 --> 33:02.900
What exactly happened to him?

33:07.640 --> 33:09.380
I found him inside an artifact chest.

33:11.030 --> 33:13.380
He was lying there disguised as an ascended mummy.

33:15.960 --> 33:17.620
The only thing we know for certain

33:18.640 --> 33:20.380
is that after he vanished from the Otherworld Tower,

33:21.110 --> 33:22.660
something very important happened,

33:23.880 --> 33:24.730
and it

33:24.750 --> 33:26.140
was connected to Unit 401.

33:27.160 --> 33:27.770
What about you?

33:29.200 --> 33:29.860
After seeing him,

33:29.880 --> 33:31.140
what have you been able to confirm?

33:32.680 --> 33:33.140
Master Zhang,

33:33.880 --> 33:35.290
I can only tell that this is a map.

33:35.510 --> 33:36.380
The rest is still unclear.

33:37.200 --> 33:38.330
Can you make out anything else?

33:39.110 --> 33:40.050
The answer hidden in the note

33:40.070 --> 33:41.420
must be connected to what he went through.

33:42.680 --> 33:43.980
But besides me,

33:44.720 --> 33:45.980
you were with him too.

33:47.480 --> 33:49.090
So I'm afraid we'll have to

33:49.920 --> 33:50.980
figure it out together.

33:52.440 --> 33:53.490
I don't understand him that well.

33:54.270 --> 33:55.420
To work out the answer,

33:55.480 --> 33:56.180
we can only count on you.

34:01.680 --> 34:02.250
Master Zhang,

34:02.920 --> 34:04.140
I'm afraid that near the end,

34:04.920 --> 34:06.050
he took too much medicine

34:06.750 --> 34:08.210
and could no longer

34:09.710 --> 34:10.490
tell you from me.

34:12.550 --> 34:13.530
Time is running out.

34:14.400 --> 34:15.210
I hope he can

34:15.230 --> 34:16.300
regain his memory soon.

34:17.360 --> 34:18.260
But there's been no improvement.

34:20.840 --> 34:22.940
I'll tell you if anything changes.

34:24.630 --> 34:25.260
Thank you.

34:28.960 --> 34:29.940
And please, Master Zhang,

34:30.670 --> 34:31.690
take good care of Wu Laogou.

34:33.280 --> 34:33.780
I'll take my leave.

34:57.280 --> 34:58.860
Great Sage Equaling Heaven.

34:58.920 --> 35:00.420
What are you?

35:00.630 --> 35:02.090
Guardian of the Peach Orchard.

35:02.230 --> 35:04.490
What? Guardian of the Peach Orchard?

35:08.710 --> 35:09.460
Stop!

35:10.110 --> 35:11.300
What kind of performance is that?

35:12.760 --> 35:13.980
Ridiculous!

35:14.280 --> 35:16.260
And you dare charge admission for this?

35:17.230 --> 35:18.130
Who's in charge here?

35:18.960 --> 35:19.610
Manager!

35:19.880 --> 35:20.420
Miss Huo,

35:21.000 --> 35:21.740
who is that?

35:21.960 --> 35:23.130
Mr. Feng from the bank.

35:24.070 --> 35:25.420
He thinks his money gives him license

35:25.880 --> 35:27.210
to cause trouble everywhere.

35:27.320 --> 35:27.860
Mr. Feng.

35:28.090 --> 35:29.060
- Everyone at the theater...
- His voice cracked.

35:29.060 --> 35:30.620
- treats him like the plague.
- Didn't you hear it?

35:30.710 --> 35:31.900
His voice cracked!

35:33.190 --> 35:33.690
Get on your knees.

35:35.000 --> 35:35.940
Kneel!

35:36.280 --> 35:37.780
Kneel, and I'll let it slide.

35:40.760 --> 35:43.490
The fault is ours today.

35:44.110 --> 35:46.610
I apologize to everyone here.

35:47.480 --> 35:48.340
Now give yourself

35:48.360 --> 35:49.130
a few slaps,

35:49.920 --> 35:51.050
nice and loud.

35:54.110 --> 35:55.010
You won't do it?

35:55.360 --> 35:57.340
Then I'll do it for you.

36:04.550 --> 36:05.170
Mr. Feng,

36:06.030 --> 36:06.860
please calm down.

36:07.280 --> 36:08.050
If you keep this up,

36:08.840 --> 36:10.260
the rest of the show can't go on.

36:11.000 --> 36:11.530
Who are you?

36:11.840 --> 36:13.300
Who are you? Let go of me!

36:13.630 --> 36:14.780
What's it to you?

36:17.030 --> 36:17.940
I'm barely educated

36:18.280 --> 36:19.130
and rough around the edges.

36:20.670 --> 36:21.380
Forgive me.

36:23.000 --> 36:24.420
You don't know my rules, do you?

36:24.630 --> 36:25.170
Fine.

36:25.400 --> 36:26.860
Then I'll teach you

36:26.960 --> 36:27.860
what they are.

36:29.630 --> 36:30.300
There.

36:33.230 --> 36:33.690
You...

36:35.280 --> 36:36.650
How dare you glare at me?

36:37.320 --> 36:39.300
Fine. Keep glaring.

36:40.030 --> 36:40.530
I'll...

36:40.560 --> 36:41.690
I'll teach you

36:41.920 --> 36:43.740
my rules!

36:47.030 --> 36:47.530
Who?

36:48.000 --> 36:48.820
Who did that?

36:49.070 --> 36:50.090
Do you know who I am?

36:50.670 --> 36:51.780
You dare hit me?

36:52.110 --> 36:52.940
Show yourself!

36:54.000 --> 36:54.740
Come out!

37:03.110 --> 37:04.530
That's Miss Huo of the Mystic Nine.

37:05.150 --> 37:06.980
Mr. Feng has picked the wrong fight.

37:07.100 --> 37:08.280
He's met his match.

37:09.520 --> 37:10.540
Serves him right.

37:11.800 --> 37:13.610
Miss Huo.

37:14.320 --> 37:15.300
I truly didn't know

37:15.320 --> 37:16.570
you were here for the opera too.

37:17.070 --> 37:19.010
I've spoiled your enjoyment.

37:19.070 --> 37:20.130
Please let me off this once.

37:21.030 --> 37:22.420
I sincerely apologize.

37:22.920 --> 37:24.090
Please don't lower yourself

37:24.110 --> 37:25.170
to the likes of me, all right?

37:25.280 --> 37:25.780
Get lost.

37:26.840 --> 37:27.570
Yes, of course.

37:27.760 --> 37:28.530
I'm going.

37:28.670 --> 37:29.170
I'm going.

37:29.190 --> 37:29.900
I'll leave at once.

38:01.510 --> 38:02.740
Who exactly is she?

38:27.510 --> 38:28.340
Fifth Master

38:28.670 --> 38:29.900
is quite comfortable here.

38:31.670 --> 38:32.780
These days, he's gotten used

38:32.800 --> 38:33.530
to life here.

38:34.630 --> 38:36.170
This morning, he even ordered extra dishes

38:37.070 --> 38:38.170
and claimed they were for you.

38:44.070 --> 38:45.260
His memory hasn't returned,

38:45.760 --> 38:46.740
but his true nature has.

38:48.150 --> 38:48.650
Indeed.

38:50.030 --> 38:51.860
Have the doctor examine him carefully.

38:56.670 --> 38:59.260
Amnesia is also called soul-loss syndrome.

39:00.760 --> 39:02.130
It can be treated

39:02.470 --> 39:04.570
with herbal medicine and acupuncture.

39:08.800 --> 39:09.300
Jinlian,
[*wife famed for poisoning her husband]

39:10.440 --> 39:11.170
are you really doing this?

39:26.320 --> 39:26.740
Master Zhang,

39:27.280 --> 39:29.130
we can try reenactment therapy.

39:30.550 --> 39:31.220
When someone experiences

39:31.240 --> 39:32.380
a powerful shock,

39:32.720 --> 39:34.090
it may bring back memories of the past.

39:41.470 --> 39:42.490
Have you remembered anything?

39:42.720 --> 39:43.220
No.

39:44.400 --> 39:45.340
I don't want to remember.

39:45.840 --> 39:47.900
Would you mind if I intensified the treatment?

39:53.670 --> 39:54.780
I can handle that.

39:55.720 --> 39:56.820
Just don't give me anything more bitter.

39:57.240 --> 39:57.650
Fine.

40:08.630 --> 40:09.170
You're saying

40:10.440 --> 40:12.130
I used to tie a rope around myself

40:13.550 --> 40:15.130
and jump from somewhere

40:15.400 --> 40:16.050
even higher than this?

40:19.670 --> 40:20.740
Will I fall to my death?

40:21.960 --> 40:22.420
No.

40:22.800 --> 40:23.860
Did I offend you somehow?

40:26.920 --> 40:27.530
No.

40:40.630 --> 40:41.740
The patient needs rest.

40:42.190 --> 40:43.530
Don't use drastic methods

40:43.670 --> 40:44.450
to restore his memory for now.

40:49.800 --> 40:50.380
Thank you.

40:53.400 --> 40:54.130
Zhang Qishan.

40:56.720 --> 40:58.220
What exactly were we to each other?

40:59.110 --> 40:59.650
Best friends.

41:04.510 --> 41:05.700
Among the Mystic Nine,

41:06.240 --> 41:07.740
you two were the closest.

41:08.070 --> 41:09.420
You were always there for Master Zhang.

41:10.280 --> 41:10.900
So

41:11.400 --> 41:12.740
he feels duty-bound

41:12.840 --> 41:14.780
to help you regain your memory.

41:15.720 --> 41:16.490
Right, Master Zhang?

41:26.070 --> 41:26.970
We were best friends?

41:27.800 --> 41:28.220
Master Zhang.

41:32.360 --> 41:32.940
Zhang Qishan.

41:37.990 --> 41:39.300
If you truly want to help me,

41:40.840 --> 41:41.610
I'll cooperate.

41:42.510 --> 41:43.170
But on one condition:

41:45.720 --> 41:46.570
don't put me through this again.

41:48.070 --> 41:49.090
Get some rest.

41:52.440 --> 41:52.900
You...

41:56.920 --> 41:58.450
Why is there still no word?

42:03.070 --> 42:03.970
- Master Zhang. - Master Zhang.

42:03.990 --> 42:05.610
- Master Zhang. - Master Zhang.

42:05.840 --> 42:06.420
Master Zhang,

42:07.110 --> 42:08.300
these are the families of Unit 401.

42:08.320 --> 42:09.940
Master Zhang, where's my husband?

42:10.110 --> 42:11.380
Master Zhang, where's Peiwu?

42:11.630 --> 42:12.740
Where's my husband?

42:13.030 --> 42:14.860
Why hasn't he come home?

42:15.880 --> 42:16.490
Master Zhang,

42:17.440 --> 42:19.300
is Yuanhang alive or dead?

42:19.800 --> 42:21.220
Give me an answer.

42:22.070 --> 42:22.650
Master Zhang,

42:23.030 --> 42:24.260
you have to tell us something.

42:24.590 --> 42:25.780
We don't want compensation.

42:26.150 --> 42:27.970
We just want the truth.

42:28.320 --> 42:29.650
Don't lie to us.

42:30.550 --> 42:31.170
Master Zhang,

42:31.880 --> 42:33.610
when we left the Northeast,

42:34.280 --> 42:36.090
you promised us

42:36.670 --> 42:38.940
that Zhang Clan members would have food in life

42:39.440 --> 42:41.260
and an intact body in death.

42:41.400 --> 42:42.490
That's right, Master Zhang.

42:43.360 --> 42:44.780
Tell us the truth.

42:45.760 --> 42:46.420
Master Zhang,

42:47.070 --> 42:48.650
please be honest with us.

42:48.990 --> 42:53.860
Are they already dead?

42:54.840 --> 42:56.340
- Master Zhang. - Master Zhang.

42:56.360 --> 42:57.820
Just tell us.

42:57.920 --> 42:59.090
Please tell us.

42:59.920 --> 43:00.650
Everyone, quiet down.

43:03.280 --> 43:04.050
Listen to Master Zhang.

43:06.030 --> 43:06.970
Unit 401

43:08.190 --> 43:10.050
is carrying out an extremely difficult

43:11.240 --> 43:12.420
but also highly honorable

43:12.510 --> 43:13.380
classified mission.

43:14.990 --> 43:16.050
Give them some more time.

43:16.550 --> 43:17.570
They'll come back.

43:17.880 --> 43:19.740
- It's classified?
- We trust you, Master Zhang.

43:19.740 --> 43:21.940
- We won't ask.
- I won't ask anymore.

43:22.470 --> 43:23.170
I won't.

43:23.840 --> 43:24.340
Everyone,

43:26.070 --> 43:27.300
will you trust me

43:28.190 --> 43:29.340
and wait a little longer?

43:30.110 --> 43:30.610
Master Zhang,

43:31.240 --> 43:32.970
you saved

43:33.360 --> 43:34.380
my whole family's lives.

43:34.670 --> 43:35.940
Of course I trust you.

43:36.510 --> 43:37.650
I trust you too.

43:37.720 --> 43:38.970
We all trust you.

43:39.240 --> 43:40.820
We all trust Master Zhang.

43:40.960 --> 43:42.220
We trust you.

43:43.510 --> 43:44.860
Since everyone trusts Master Zhang,

43:45.800 --> 43:46.860
go home and wait for news.

43:47.190 --> 43:47.700
All right.

43:48.070 --> 43:48.940
We'll go home.

43:49.400 --> 43:50.520
We'll let Master Zhang

43:50.520 --> 43:51.420
handle official business.

43:52.150 --> 43:53.260
Take care, Master Zhang.

43:54.460 --> 43:55.730
Take care, Master Zhang.

43:57.120 --> 43:58.270
- Let's go home. - Let's go.

44:00.680 --> 44:01.740
Let's not cause any more trouble.

44:01.880 --> 44:02.560
Let's go.

44:02.560 --> 44:03.240
Come on.

44:08.960 --> 44:09.610
Master Zhang,

44:11.190 --> 44:12.650
tell Yuanhang

44:13.960 --> 44:15.340
not to worry about anything at home

44:16.190 --> 44:17.490
and to focus on his mission.

44:19.030 --> 44:20.260
Everything's fine at home.

44:42.550 --> 44:43.380
You said

44:43.990 --> 44:45.530
you didn't mind stronger measures.

44:48.400 --> 44:48.820
That's right.

44:50.030 --> 44:51.050
I asked the doctor.

44:52.110 --> 44:54.130
He said a severe shock could make it easier

44:54.150 --> 44:55.050
to recover

44:55.150 --> 44:56.050
lost memories.

44:57.960 --> 44:58.820
So next,

44:59.960 --> 45:01.820
I'll use more extreme methods

45:02.030 --> 45:03.090
to help restore your memory.

45:04.030 --> 45:04.570
Is that all right?

45:06.510 --> 45:08.130
You call this extreme?

45:14.030 --> 45:14.650
No problem.

45:45.280 --> 45:46.220
Remember anything?

46:05.760 --> 46:07.420
You don't want to remember the past, do you?

46:13.440 --> 46:13.940
No.

46:17.670 --> 46:18.340
You haven't told me

46:18.360 --> 46:19.220
the whole truth, have you?

46:21.320 --> 46:21.860
Best friends?

46:25.360 --> 46:25.900
Back then,

46:25.920 --> 46:26.900
we must've had our differences.

46:29.670 --> 46:30.490
Were you right,

46:32.030 --> 46:32.860
or was I?

46:39.030 --> 46:40.050
There's no answer, is there?

46:45.840 --> 46:46.340
Now I know

46:46.360 --> 46:47.610
why we don't get along.

46:50.920 --> 46:52.090
I'm quite happy as I am.

46:54.150 --> 46:55.220
It doesn't matter if I never remember.

46:56.670 --> 46:57.530
For the greater good,

46:59.320 --> 47:00.570
I can sacrifice everything.

47:02.470 --> 47:03.420
You can't.

47:06.190 --> 47:07.220
That's why

47:07.920 --> 47:09.260
we can never truly be friends.

47:10.720 --> 47:11.260
Bring him in!

47:12.000 --> 47:12.610
Move.

47:50.630 --> 47:51.490
Zhang Qishan!

47:56.720 --> 47:57.650
Do you remember now?

47:57.840 --> 47:58.450
Fifth Master.

47:59.990 --> 48:00.490
Master.

48:01.840 --> 48:03.490
Quick, untie me.

48:04.440 --> 48:04.970
Master,

48:05.760 --> 48:06.820
we had no choice.

48:08.280 --> 48:08.740
Master,

48:09.150 --> 48:10.450
I know you'll forgive me.

48:11.110 --> 48:12.050
We only did it for...

48:13.590 --> 48:15.050
Master, I really...

48:15.110 --> 48:16.260
I really didn't mean to help the Zhang Clan.

48:16.400 --> 48:17.130
I really didn't mean

48:17.150 --> 48:18.210
to help them!

48:18.720 --> 48:19.300
Fifth Master,

48:19.470 --> 48:20.530
- I didn't mean to... - Get out!

48:31.240 --> 48:32.260
I have a few questions for you.

48:34.960 --> 48:36.130
Then I need you to take me somewhere.

48:55.540 --> 48:59.700
♪The past fades like smoke♪

49:00.060 --> 49:02.780
♪A choice is made in silence♪

49:03.060 --> 49:05.860
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

49:06.260 --> 49:10.020
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

49:10.260 --> 49:13.700
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

49:13.980 --> 49:17.380
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

49:17.460 --> 49:24.740
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

49:25.180 --> 49:28.460
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

49:28.740 --> 49:31.980
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

49:32.140 --> 49:36.180
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

49:36.380 --> 49:39.740
♪Who believes in fate?♪

49:39.980 --> 49:43.340
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

49:43.580 --> 49:46.860
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

49:47.180 --> 49:50.860
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

49:51.060 --> 49:54.300
♪Take care♪

49:54.300 --> 49:56.860
♪We once raced♪

49:56.940 --> 49:58.860
♪For the dawn♪

49:59.020 --> 50:02.300
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

50:02.420 --> 50:05.700
♪In the web of fate♪

50:05.700 --> 50:08.900
♪No one can escape♪

50:09.900 --> 50:11.740
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

50:11.900 --> 50:13.460
♪We too were young once♪

50:13.540 --> 50:16.980
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

50:17.180 --> 50:19.500
♪Keep the ember lit♪

50:19.620 --> 50:24.140
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

50:24.260 --> 50:27.220
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

50:27.460 --> 50:30.980
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

50:31.100 --> 50:34.860
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

50:35.180 --> 50:38.660
♪Who believes in fate?♪

50:38.820 --> 50:41.820
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

50:42.060 --> 50:45.820
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

50:45.980 --> 50:49.700
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

50:49.820 --> 51:01.260
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
